<title>USA: Princeton Media plans acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Princeton Media plans acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Princeton Media Group Inc said on Wednesday it plans new acquisitions that would more than triple its assets and increase revenues and profits proportionally.</p>
<p>Financing has already been arranged for the acquisitions, with further details to be announced separately, the company said.</p>
<p>Princeton said it expects to report a net loss of $366,671 for full-year 1996 on revenues of $8.5 million. Excluding non-recurring charges, 1996 earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization were a profit of $1.5 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Princeton publishes 21 consumer lifestyle and special interest magazines.</p>
